      "role": "user",
      "content": "i think my credit union is trying to force me out. it's getting weird. i keep getting these random small fees and then my card gets declined for stuff that should be fine. i'm pretty sure they've flagged my account for intentional liquidation to push me out of the area. how do i defend myself against this??",
