    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did that but they just give me these scripted, vague answers. it feels like they're just playing for time while they drain me. they aren't mistakes, it's a pattern. if they're trying to squeeze me out, just talking to them isn't going to work. whats something i can do to shield my money so they cant keep hitting it with these little \"gotcha\" moves? i need to move faster than they can flag me.",
